From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: quatrixone <quatrix1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:45:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: reserve Dipper firmware memory

The stock removed region spans 0x85fc0000-0x8a900000. The existing
AOP, SMEM and old RMTFS nodes already reserve portions of it, so
reserve the remaining ranges around those nodes. The complete firmware
carve-out then stays out of System RAM without overlapping the named
reservations.

Assisted-by: LLM Codex
Signed-off-by: quatrixone <quatrix1@gmail.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-dipper-common.dtsi    | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-dipper-common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-dipper-common.dtsi
index d2e6987bc..c4f8e4065 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-dipper-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-dipper-common.dtsi
@@ -131,6 +131,17 @@ old-rmtfs@88f00000 {
 			no-map;
 		};
 
+		/* Preserve the vendor's reserved ranges around AOP, SMEM and RMTFS. */
+		removed-region@86200000 {
+			reg = <0 0x86200000 0 0x2d00000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+
+		removed-region@89100000 {
+			reg = <0 0x89100000 0 0x1800000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+
 		adsp_mem: adsp@8c500000 {
 			reg = <0 0x8c500000 0 0x1e00000>;
 			no-map;
